<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Fade in:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Convention Center</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Kelly Mae is preparing for her live remote on air. She’s pulling hairs off her blouse and fluffing her hair while she speaks into her ear piece.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The camera flounders around zooming in on various things as it prepares for the live shot as well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>We catch de-contextual glimpses of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KM</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What do you think the odds are he went?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I was on </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">WebMD</Text>
      <Text> all night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I know what I’m talking about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s in the eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dr. Eliza Harold and a hazmat suited person stand near the entrance to the convention center.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KelLY MAE (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bob is in there, Olivia.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can feel it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>By this time the camera is focused in on Kelly Mae, ready to go live.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KellY MAE (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m reporting on a quarantine that was probably started by my boss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No Olivia, I’m not going to say that on air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’ve done plenty of live remotes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah. It’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">kinda</Text>
      <Text> my </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">thi-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Why didn’t you-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s right Dane.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>NOHO STINGER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANE"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIVIA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Behind the Camera - Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia stands behind the camera and speaks into her headset.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Annnnnd</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Smash to commercial.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia rests her headphones on her neck. Olivia settles into annoyed attack mode, her target: Dane at the desk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah. I can do stuff.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey look, I just don’t feel comfortable doing this show with the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">real</Text>
      <Text> producer down for the count.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Did they teach </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">you</Text>
      <Text> how to produce </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">news</Text>
      <Text> at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">writing</Text>
      <Text> school?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia stares blankly. She slowly raises her headphones to her ears.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re going live.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia uses her hand to count down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In three.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia flicks Dane off as we can hear the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">NoHo</Text>
      <Text> Rag stinger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dane looks flummoxed at the desk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Welcome back, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">NoHo</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>If you’re just joining us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The 2016 Pacific Lifestyle and Leisure expo is quarantined under a suspected outbreak of Acute Pneumococcal Alpaca Fever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">CDC</Text>
      <Text> is on site, investigating the matter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The Rag’s own Kelly Mae </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Greenblatt</Text>
      <Text> is live at the convention center.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KM</Text>
      <Text>, I can’t imagine what it’s like inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOB"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="HUNTER"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. ConvenTION CENTER - No time passed</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The convention center is empty. Devoid of motion. It looks like a nice place to spend an afternoon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A chair sits as part of the scene, Bob is resting in it, comatose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob sits motionless, head leaning back. Eyes closed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Suddenly, he wakes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob gasps as he looks around. He’s sitting in an evacuated convention center hall. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Departure by the Moody Blues cues. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He rubs his eyes and attempts to sit more upright in the chair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob sinks back into the chair and his eyes go wide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SLAM. Bob’s world drips with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">technicolor</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>His head goes fuzzy, time slows, speech slurs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Bob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This isn’t home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob’s words stretch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hunter (o.s.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Home? No, this isn’t home. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s a madhouse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>HUNTER S. THOMPSON walks into Bob’s hallucinatory gaze.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hunter (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The wolves. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They’re at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And they’re here for you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Bob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Which way out?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob’s words lift and twist on the wind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As Hunter begins, Bob stands, looking noticeably healthier and wearing a bandana.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I know the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But listen:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It won’t be easy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob looks resolute.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HunTER (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(over the Bob look)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I could see in his eyes that no matter what was coursing through his veins...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He was ready.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOB"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="HUNTER"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Forest - Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hunter</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ll face three trials on your trip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>First, watch your step.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob ambles into frame, then stumbles on an exposed root in the path.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hunter (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Here the trip turns sour.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Your breakfast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ll see it again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob heaves next to a tree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hunter (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now, don’t think you’re in the clear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob walks through the inner forest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The hardest is yet to come.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ll be confronted by two grotesque creatures.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Doc and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Astro</Text>
      <Text> appear on the path before Bob.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They’ll overwhelm you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Doc and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Astro</Text>
      <Text> greet Bob. He bends down to scratch </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Astro’s</Text>
      <Text> belly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Doc approaches and goes in tail wagging. Bob sees him and greets him. Doc rolls over on his back. Bob does the same.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Pin you to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As Bob lay on the ground, Doc climbs into position on Bob’s chest and proceeds to lick Bob’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t let them take you down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t do it, man!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob returns to Hunter, exhausted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Bob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I couldn’t do it...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They were too fuzzy...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Hunter looks annoyed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HUNTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Damn it man!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Have you tried the front door?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>It dawns on Bob.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Of course!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob ambles off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Desk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dane slouches at the desk, looking off to the side of the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to Olivia)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What does that mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That hand signal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Does that mean we’re on?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dane adjusts quickly back to polished newsman.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Thanks for sticking with us </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">NoHo</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIVIA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Behind the Camera</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia stands head in hand. She rubs her face then talks into her headset.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Alright</Text>
      <Text> Kelly Mae, we just got the ALL CLEAR from the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">CDC</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So we’re go for interview.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Meet Dr. Harold inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KELLY MAE (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Inside?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Desk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We now go back live to Kelly Mae with the latest on the convention quarantine. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KM</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Convention Center - Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Kelly Mae stands, mouth agape, finger to ear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KellY MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes, I’m now being told we have an all clear!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Let’s head </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">inside</Text>
      <Text> for a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">quick</Text>
      <Text> comment from Southwest regional </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">CDC</Text>
      <Text> director. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Dr. Eliza Harold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Kelly Mae walks hurriedly towards the front entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOB"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELIZA HAROLD"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="HAZMAT GUY"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Convention center entrance - no timE PASSED</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob ambles towards the front door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The sound of the ocean and seagulls rises in the mix.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A faint smile crests Bob’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Bob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(calmly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Kelly Mae rushes towards the entrance and sees Bob standing inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Through the glass, Kelly Mae exclaims</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly Mae</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bob?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I knew it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob pushes the door open and brushes past Kelly Mae.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly MAE (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>How could you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob turns to Kelly Mae.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Bob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(satiated)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Leisure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KELLY MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh god, you’re hallucinating!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You are </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">the most</Text>
      <Text> contagious right now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I have no words.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Kelly Mae sneezes. And suddenly tenses with fear. Eliza Harold sees and points. The hazmat suited person runs towards </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KM</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Eliza Harold</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(shouting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Neutralize the contagion!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Psychosomatic!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Psychosomatic!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HAZMAT Guy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Remain Calm!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The Hazmat guy tackles Kelly Mae.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly MAE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Get off me, you psycho!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He’s getting away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob ambles away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ElizA HAROLD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We got her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Situation contained.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANE"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Noho rag desk - no TIME PASSED</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dane sits mouth agape.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Heck of a scoop you got there, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">KM</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Kelly MAE (o.s.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey! Hey! No! Get someone down here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DANE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You went with a camera man!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KELLY MAE (o.s.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(hurried)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They have him inside. I don’t know what they’re going to do with him!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIVIA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Behind thE CAMERA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Olivia motions to Dane to wrap up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>OliviA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wrap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Desk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Dane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to Olivia)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey, Bob said we needed to boost ratings!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This is how we do it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Dane’s eyes light up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DanE (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to himself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bob!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You genius!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KELLY MAE"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OLIVIA"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Beach at sunset.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob stands, toes in the sand, looking blissful but still sweaty and beet red sick. Seriously ill.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KELLY MAE (o.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Call someone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Anyone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to hazmat guy)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey! I have rights!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Olivia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A genius would’ve stayed at home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bob’s no genius.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He’s just a crazy sick dingus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Bob drops to the ground like a bag of bricks. A rag doll. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Big wide shot with Bob collapsed on the sand with a stupid grin cresting his sweaty face. Sun setting over the ocean.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>End.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

